    <title>忠于自我，做不完美的自己 - 那些影视剧里闪闪发光的女性</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64057c6c2b769b7327bea4d6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64057c6c2b769b7327bea4d6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 Mar 2023 05:38:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在三八国际劳动妇女节来临之际，我们想聊一聊一些在影视作品中给我们留下深刻印象的女性角色。从她们身上，我们或学到其坚强，或理解其脆弱，或感染于其热情，或感动于其坚韧。欢迎随着本期节目和我们一起回顾这些年留给我们深刻印象的影视作品中的女性角色。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>首尾BGM🎵</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《The Man》 Taylor Swift</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Mystery of Love》 Sufjan Stevens</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提到的作品📖🎬：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>影视</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《瞬息全宇宙》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《傲骨贤妻（The Good Wife）》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35430833/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35430833/"><span>塔尔 Tár‎</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《美国夫人 Mrs. America》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《大法官金斯伯格 RBG‎》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《欲望都市Sex and The City》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《请以你的名字呼唤我 Call Me byYour Name》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《末路狂花 Thelma &amp;Louise》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>脱口秀</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>黄阿丽：小眼镜蛇 Ali Wong:Baby Cobra‎ (2016)</span></p><span></span><p><span>黄阿丽：铁娘子 Ali Wong:Hard Knock Wife‎(2018)</span></p><span></span><p><span>黄阿丽：风流女子 Ali Wong:Don Wong‎ (2022)</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>书籍</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《从0开始的女性主义》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《第二性》波伏娃</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你有什么喜欢的作品和角色，欢迎留言告诉我们！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>感谢你的留言或分享，比心～❤️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>主播：皮皮/星星</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/5530727617" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/5530727617"><span>微博 @phiphiwearshwat</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a96d5ba4eacab3a7d85df75" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a96d5ba4eacab3a7d85df75"><span>小红书 @phiphiwearswhat</span></a></p>]]></description>
